<title>UK: Core delays posting Scott offer document.</title>
<headline>Core delays posting Scott offer document.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S.-based laboratory services group Core Laboratories NV said on Tuesday that it had delayed the posting of its offer document for Scott Pickford Plc until further notice.</p>
<p>Core said it was a pre-condition to posting the offer document that Scott Pickford recommend the offer by January 27.</p>
<p>Core, which has acceptances for 47.56 percent of the firm, raised its offer for the British geoscience service company on January 20 to 57p per share from 53p.</p>
<p>It is fighting for control of the company with Australia's Aerodata Holdings, which has built up a 21.5 percent stake in Scott.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
